# SINE-LABEL: code f4:Body
# SINE: = Call
# function root() { return Math.sqrt(-1); } the sign of a NaN that the processor makes differs between processors
# RUN(ROOT): walk f5 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+Folding+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers
# ROOT-LABEL: code f5:Body
# ROOT: = Call

